    {"claim_id": "linux-pipe-contract", "text": "Linux pipe(2) documents a unidirectional IPC data channel with a read end and write end; data written to the write end is buffered by the kernel until read from the read end.", "source_ids": ["linux-pipe-2"], "answer_locations": ["核心结论", "1 分钟版", "3 分钟版", "关键细节", "原理机制", "常见追问", "易错点"]},
    {"claim_id": "linux-posix-mq-contract", "text": "Linux mq_overview(7) documents POSIX message queues as processes exchanging data in messages; queues are named, opened with mq_open, use mq_send/mq_receive, and are delivered highest-priority first.", "source_ids": ["linux-mq-overview-7"], "answer_locations": ["核心结论", "1 分钟版", "3 分钟版", "关键细节", "原理机制", "常见追问"]},
    {"claim_id": "linux-shm-and-semaphore-boundary", "text": "Linux shm_overview(7) documents POSIX shared memory mapping with shm_open, ftruncate and mmap, and says processes typically need synchronization such as POSIX semaphores. Linux sem_overview(7) documents semaphores as synchronization for processes and threads, using sem_post and sem_wait, and process-shared unnamed semaphores residing in shared memory.", "source_ids": ["linux-shm-overview-7", "linux-sem-overview-7"], "answer_locations": ["核心结论", "1 分钟版", "3 分钟版", "关键细节", "原理机制", "常见追问", "易错点"]},
    {"claim_id": "linux-unix-socket-contract", "text": "Linux unix(7) documents AF_UNIX/AF_LOCAL as local-machine process communication, supporting SOCK_STREAM, SOCK_DGRAM and Linux SOCK_SEQPACKET, and supporting ancillary-data transfer of file descriptors or process credentials.", "source_ids": ["linux-unix-7"], "answer_locations": ["核心结论", "1 分钟版", "3 分钟版", "关键细节", "原理机制", "常见追问", "易错点"]},
    {"claim_id": "linux-signal-notification-contract", "text": "Linux signal(7) documents signals, kill for sending to a specified process, and sigqueue for sending a real-time signal with accompanying data; it also documents asynchronous handlers and synchronous signal-acceptance APIs.", "source_ids": ["linux-signal-7"], "answer_locations": ["核心结论", "1 分钟版", "3 分钟版", "原理机制", "常见追问", "易错点"]}
